{"id":"FR1931476240","current":{"csp":"Rescale","cso":"Rescale Platform","status":"FedRAMP Certified","phase":"Ongoing Certification","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C","impact_level":"Unknown","independent_assessor":"Fortreum, LLC","partnering_agency":null,"annual_assessment":null,"cert_date":"2022-01-31T05:00:00.000Z","under_cap":false,"service_model":["SaaS","PaaS"],"deployment_model":"Public Cloud","business_categories":["Analytics","Collaboration","Data Management","Development Tools","Operations Management","Research","System Administration"],"fedramp_msg":"","ready_status":"Unknown","ip_jab_status":"Unknown","ip_pmo_status":"Unknown","ip_agency_status":"Unknown","ip_prog_status":"Unknown","small_business":false,"uei":"HPSAC9M3RS44","service_acronym":"Rescale Platform","website":"https://rescale.com/","sales_email":"public.sector@rescale.com","security_email":"fedramp@rescale.com","trust_center":null,"secure_configuration_guidance":null,"certified_services":[],"third_party_information_resources":null,"independent_assessor_id":"201664","status_date":"2022-01-31T05:00:00.000Z","cap_date":null,"service_desc":"Rescale advances innovation through a mission-ready digital engineering platform for new capability development and R&D that integrates cloud high performance computing resources, intelligent data management tools, and applied AI to accelerate modeling and simulation.\r\n\r\nRescale provides a secure and compliant platform for modernizing legacy systems and optimizing resources. The service offers intelligent automation and scalable compute infrastructure, enabling users to meet demands for speed and usability. \r\n\r\nKey platform capabilities for the public sector:\r\n\r\n●\tMulti-cloud high performance computing (HPC), data, and AI services: On-demand access to the latest computing architectures—CPUs, GPUs, storage, and networking—with automated optimization for cost, speed, and performance.\r\n\r\n●\tPre-integrated ecosystem of 1,250+ engineering, simulation, and AI applications: Supporting commercial, open-source, government-developed, and bring-your-own software—delivered securely with end-to-end data integration.\r\n\r\n●\tApplied AI and generative capabilities: Integrated into modeling, simulation, and R&D workflows to accelerate productivity and uncover deeper insights.\r\n\r\n●\tEnd-to-end digital thread support: Flexible platform that connects compute, software, data, and automation—from initial design through production-grade deployment.\r\n\r\n●\tIntelligent workload orchestration: Proprietary intelligence matches workloads to ideal hardware/software combinations, enabling maximum performance with minimum overhead.\r\n\r\n●\tMission-focused user and IT experience: Single-pane-of-glass interface for engineers, scientists, and IT teams to manage resources, configurations, software licensing, and policy enforcement. The intuitive user experience is designed to support user needs, regardless of proficiency with HPC. \r\n\r\nThe Rescale Platform supports a variety of use cases including:\r\n●\tHigh Performance Computing Cloud Bursting & Migration\r\n●\tModeling & Simulation Performance Optimization\r\n●\tGPU Acceleration\r\n●\tFinancial Management & Cost Optimization\r\n●\tSecurity & Compliance Management\r\n●\tApplication & License Management\r\n●\tCloud & Hardware Resource Orchestration\r\n●\tSimulation Data & Workflow Management\r\n●\tComputer-Aided Engineering (CAE)\r\n●\tComputational Fluid Dynamics (CFD)\r\n●\tAI/ML for Engineering & Scientific R&D\r\n\r\nThe Rescale Platform is compliant with the following standards:\r\n\r\n●\tFedRAMP Moderate Authorized\r\n●\tU.S. International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR)\r\n●\tDefense Federal Acquisition Regulation Supplement (DFARS) 252.204-7012\r\n●\tCloud Security Alliance (CSA)\r\n●\tAmerican Institute of CPAs: Service Organization Control (AICPA SOC2 Type 2)","event_log":[{"date":"2020-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Chan